Reviewed-by: Bryan O'Donoghue <bryan.odonoghue@linaro.org>
Co-developed-by: Dmitry Baryshkov <dmitry.baryshkov@oss.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Dmitry Baryshkov <dmitry.baryshkov@oss.qualcomm.com>
